msgid ""
"与卡片 UI 的“表面”分组一致。当前 `表面薄层扫描` 根据晶面、厚度和真空设置生成自由表面； "
"如果还要加入空位或吸附原子，应在它之后连接“缺陷”分组中的对应卡片。"
msgstr "This section matches the `Surfaces` group in the card picker. `Surface Slab Scan` creates a free surface from the specified plane, thickness, and vacuum settings. To add vacancies or adsorbates, connect the corresponding card from the `Defects` group after it."
